blocks.en:
ColSAT applies the standard separating-axis test [ 5 ] to every pair of Studio [ 2 ] collision boxes;
touching boxes do not collide.

Table 1 in the main paper counts only the later-placed part of each remaining colliding pair.

blocks.zh:
ColSAT将标准分离轴测试[5]适用于每对工作室[2]碰撞箱;
触摸的盒子不会碰撞。

主纸的表1只计算每个剩余碰撞对中较后放置的部分。
